    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n109594" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπο-χρίω</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">[ῑ</span>], <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>smear under</i> or <i>on, besmear, anoint,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινί τι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					2.86
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Fract.</u>
				21
			</span></i>; <i>paint</i> another's <i>face under the eyes,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Cyr.</u>
				8.8.20
			</span></i>:—
				Med.
			, <i>paint oneself,</i>
