				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπογράφω</span> v) ib.<i><span class="en">
				8.1.41
			</span></i>; <i>anoint oneself slightly,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Aret.
				<u>CD</u>
				1.3
			</span></i>.</div>
